{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">佘詩曼（阿佘）今日（2日）於社交平台大晒多張與圈中好友陳山聰等人的鬼馬聚會合照，原來他們是特意為「壽星仔」陳山聰祝賀50歲生日。早前阿佘自爆不幸遭遇食物中毒，幸好於此次大餐前及時痊癒，亦令她不禁感歎「個肚好爭氣」！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">相中可見，阿佘當日身穿黑色長袖薄紗上衣，搭配珍珠頸鍊與黑色美甲，氣質爆燈。雖然病後初癒暴瘦，但她精神狀態極佳，更於鏡頭前展現鬼馬一面！見她不僅手捧精緻甜品做出閉眼嘟嘴的可愛表情，更躲在陳山聰身後高舉雙手擺出「50」字樣的Pose，活力十足。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"fcf6ec07-ee48-41ab-8042-506e07c132a9.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026J6VmuBQRvk1790934101.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"fcf6ec07-ee48-41ab-8042-506e07c132a9.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"62de2fcb-4997-4d88-807d-7829cff82dd0.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026kS7RFO3ph31790934101.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"62de2fcb-4997-4d88-807d-7829cff82dd0.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">今次這頓生日盛宴可謂來之不易，阿佘感性又搞笑地發文寫道：「好彩個肚爭氣，喺食呢餐飯之前好返，如果唔係我真係癲俾你睇！訂咗兩個月，我哋熱切期待，終於食到，果然冇令我哋失望！超好味～」相中亦大方展示了多款巧奪天工的頂級料理，包括用橙皮裝盛的極致甜品、油花勻稱的頂級和牛、精緻燒物及特色米飯等，令人看到口水直流！</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T09:58:34.945536+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":382,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}